  then ok "secret writers: the probe comes first; viaSwitch and dies on every write, names and never a value"; else bad "secret writers: what was sent" "$(cat "$T/wsb/calls" | head -c 2500)"; fi
  # --- 2d. the door follows a revoke -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # A revoked person's door is closed on the routed path exactly as on the file (revoke-access: door_state is in its scope).
